ue aumentan su fuerza hasta límites insospechados. Tiene el cabello rojo y una prominente mandíbula. Su único ojo, el izquierdo es de color azul. Su extraño sentido del humor se pone de manifiesto en una serie de aventuras a lo largo del mundo, en las que se enfrenta a diversos enemigos, especialmente a Bluto, que está enamorado de Olivia, la novia de Popeye.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQPDl1S1pRg2jzCQWtVUuauZSqa.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2YeQEGqzE0FDto39IiWRlDg9lN6.jpg","voteAverage":7.1,"voteCount":408,"releaseDate":"1960-06-10","genres":["Animación","Kids"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":8392,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":221,"title":"The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis","originalTitle":"The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohfexyzqLUUJ0S1n9zMrCMUlgjD.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iIeZvExIDXBQbihb5xLeVGVHkM5.jpg","voteAverage":6.4,"voteCount":17,"releaseDate":"1959-09-29","genres":["Comedia"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":221,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":6647,"title":"Belleza y poder","originalTitle":"Belleza y poder","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbmLSQHmSSCBhSfRhvToAEvSsqI.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/slVKYnKNyfcPv35AG3MXlAq9IqV.jpg","voteAverage":5.6,"voteCount":144,"releaseDate":"1987-03-23","genres":["Soap","Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":6647,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":79340,"title":"The Outpost","originalTitle":"The Outpost","overview":"Talon, la única superviviente de una raza llamada Sangrenegras, se lanza al borde de la civilización para rastrear a los asesinos de su familia. En su viaje, descubre que tiene poderes sobrenaturales que debe aprender a utilizar para alcanzar sus objetivos.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlfgeE8mhEhBbkdfYeSGv0KXRhw.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fjrye2LYD8fu4tuaQdZCrkTbGVe.jpg","voteAverage":7.5,"voteCount":268,"releaseDate":"2018-07-10","genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure","Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":79340,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":300131,"title":"Kill Blue","originalTitle":"Kill Blue","overview":"El legendario sicario Juzo Ogami jamás ha fallado en una misión. Pero tras una de ellas, una misteriosa avispa lo pica y despierta en el cuerpo de un niño de 13 años.\n\nY para colmo, recibe una extraña orden: infiltrarse en una escuela secundaria. Ahora, el otrora temido asesino debe compaginar el caos de la vida escolar con su letal trabajo, ¡mientras busca la manera de recuperar su cuerpo de adulto!","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hzamo8nOZmurGQQ7P2uqpsGHek.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jOxZVOYxghHw6ofH1QFG6ZQUt2V.jpg","voteAverage":9,"voteCount":15,"releaseDate":"2026-04-11","genres":["Animación","Action & Adventure","Comedia"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":300131,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":9895,"title":"Rowan & Martin's Laugh-In","originalTitle":"Rowan & Martin's Laugh-In","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abMymAYr5R1yVeNl9NZs3x27RoY.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iFB8TiYON7yC3qO6f0jfLd3YKVp.jpg","voteAverage":6.7,"voteCount":35,"releaseDate":"1968-01-22","genres":["Comedia"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":9895,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":3232,"title":"Fury","originalTitle":"Fury","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zevaClItrM7FrNcypkYDkjjwgsc.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/n8PICamZ41y3hE2jVr8nBXzG7id.jpg","voteAverage":6.5,"voteCount":15,"releaseDate":"1955-10-15","genres":["Western","Action & Adventure"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":3232,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":277513,"title":"Watashi ga Koibito ni Nareru Wake Nai jan, Muri Muri! (※Muri ja Nakatta!?)","originalTitle":"Watashi ga Koibito ni Nareru Wake Nai jan, Muri Muri! (※Muri ja Nakatta!?)","overview":"Renako Amaori quiere una vida normal en la preparatoria, pero todo cambia al conocer a Mai Ouzuka, la estrella de la escuela. Su amistad se complica cuando Mai le confiesa su amor, desatando un torbellino de emociones mientras Renako intenta mantenerlas como amigas.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTZzpIktlKx6fmmsIaUu4usUah1.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/xMn1Fc4Go36WxZTgx4txH1Lkn3B.jpg","voteAverage":8.1,"voteCount":40,"releaseDate":"2025-07-08","genres":["Animación","Comedia"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":277513,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":5303,"title":"El Cuentacuentos","originalTitle":"El Cuentacuentos","overview":"La serie relata legendarios cuentos europeos a través de la combinación de actuación de actores reales y marionetas. La temática de dichos cuentos es muy variada, pero tratan los temas universales propios del folclore y de la tradición de los cuentos de hadas. Los episodios son contados por un viejo narrador, representado por John Hurt, sentado junto a una chimenea en un antiguo castillo renacentista, y siempre acompañado por su perro parlante, cuya peculiar voz era aportada por Brian Henson. Cabe destacar, como detalle curioso, el significado y simbolismo que el número tres tiene en cada capítulo.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M8QXTDpEJ6Z9NvdCsNodtre1Wb.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/celzfQGiEaOLzZaGPYrO3fP2ogX.jpg","voteAverage":8.2,"voteCount":237,"releaseDate":"1988-05-15","genres":["Action & Adventure","Familia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":5303,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":126,"title":"Misterios sin Resolver: Episodios Originales de Robert Stack","originalTitle":"Misterios sin Resolver: Episodios Originales de Robert Stack","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bOXbWqNsRU2ykPiE586I18coLf.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jCXk0VvqiyulPBzHf1hDN1PK0mW.jpg","voteAverage":7.7,"voteCount":148,"releaseDate":"1988-10-05","genres":["Misterio","Drama","Crimen"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":126,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":4612,"title":"Pee-wee's Playhouse","originalTitle":"Pee-wee's Playhouse","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whb9VJJdDlRjJLrRrQl1NkyD3Dc.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/kSuOfS88MPwr4gxkdmE6GFQjXQd.jpg","voteAverage":7.1,"voteCount":56,"releaseDate":"1986-09-13","genres":["Kids","Comedia"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":4612,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":259544,"title":"Jigoku Sensei Nube","originalTitle":"Jigoku Sensei Nube","overview":"En la Escuela Primaria Dōmori, fenómenos extraños amenazan a los alumnos, y Nube, su maestro, usa la Mano del Demonio y otras habilidades espirituales para protegerlos. Cada episodio trae un nuevo desafío, enseñando valiosas lecciones, con algunos arcos más largos y enemigos recurrentes.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRrTEFXGYYBdQAXxDkb5IapjPCV.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/vdMoQCiHQNtrbjp7SmFGG2i76g0.jpg","voteAverage":8.5,"voteCount":15,"releaseDate":"2025-07-02","genres":["Animación","Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":259544,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":15680,"title":"暴れん坊将軍","originalTitle":"暴れん坊将軍","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yveXoUqTHSdWDWwzXs23uMlNOTU.jpg","backdropPath":"https: