https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mH0HgaNSO3s4i6L6SQyGsFCbwJC.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/d1wj4WQ87tj7dLgXCKfPOe8AOz4.jpg","voteAverage":7.8,"voteCount":555,"releaseDate":"1977-03-27","genres":["Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":19649,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":248866,"title":"Mi amiga Nokotan es un ciervo","originalTitle":"Mi amiga Nokotan es un ciervo","overview":"Nadie sabe que Torako solía ser un delincuente. Todos sus compañeros sólo la conocen como la estudiante perfecta. Pero todo cambia cuando Nokotan, una estudiante transferida con astas, entra en su vida. Las astas no son lo único extraño de Nokotan. ¡Su nariz de venado puede olfatear el pasado secreto de Torako! Ya sea en la escuela o en el zoológico, el caos sigue cada paso de esta niña de ojos saltones. ¡Torako tiene tantas preguntas! ¿Nokotan es un ciervo, una niña o algo intermedio?","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0QTVYrt6loiDcTJOpJg7NE10Oo.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6GmVVDEjnA4HuSany5otbR8xaET.jpg","voteAverage":7.7,"voteCount":80,"releaseDate":"2024-07-07","genres":["Animación","Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":248866,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":2357,"title":"Edgemont","originalTitle":"Edgemont","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nY9Uttet0NikmvHO385S8C7YKhl.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/nB40P63fBWZhiFnMfWO1unYDo7K.jpg","voteAverage":6.3,"voteCount":6,"releaseDate":"2001-01-04","genres":["Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":2357,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":523,"title":"Pensacola: Alas de Oro","originalTitle":"Pensacola: Alas de Oro","overview":"Pensacola: Wings of Gold es una serie dramática estadounidense de acción y aventuras basada en la Estación Aeronaval de Pensacola, en Pensacola, Florida.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fdZmNKmvGAFRXYFmWtgUipc0hG.jpg","backdropPath":"/placeholder-backdrop.jpg","voteAverage":6.6,"voteCount":15,"releaseDate":"1997-09-15","genres":["Action & Adventure","Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":523,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":4379,"title":"Riptide","originalTitle":"Riptide","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bw5CgVgGDbPSX6YMo81x1ND9s2.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/h4eeNs1ODQpx8RrILsxTmMt7aqR.jpg","voteAverage":6.8,"voteCount":59,"releaseDate":"1984-01-03","genres":["Crimen","Drama","Action & Adventure"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":4379,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":1794,"title":"Defenders of the Earth","originalTitle":"Defenders of the Earth","overview":"Defenders of the Earth es una serie de televisión animada estadounidense producida en 1986, con personajes de tres tiras cómicas distribuidas por King Features Syndicate: Flash Gordon, The Phantom y Mandrake the Magician, que se oponen a Ming the Merciless en el año 2015. Los personajes secundarios incluyen a sus los niños Rick Gordon, Jedda Walker, Kshin, el asistente de Mandrake, Lothar, y el hijo de Lothar, LJ. El programa duró 65 episodios; También hubo una serie de cómics de corta duración publicada por Star Comics, creada por Gerry Conway, Ross Andru y John Romita, Sr. .. Los créditos finales dan crédito a Rob Walsh y Tony Pastor por la música principal y Stan Lee por la letra. . La serie se mostró más tarde en reposiciones en el Sci Fi Channel como parte de Sci Fi Cartoon Quest.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOkcLTooM93GKUpUfIqc8FTy2Ta.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/uEsuf0fkPkWrMCPD3inNhnqE50y.jpg","voteAverage":7.6,"voteCount":94,"releaseDate":"1986-09-08","genres":["Animación","Action & Adventure"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":1794,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":529,"title":"El principe valiente","originalTitle":"El principe valiente","overview":"Situado en la época del Rey Arturo, narra las aventuras de un príncipe exiliado que busca Camelot para convertirse en uno de los Caballeros de la Mesa Redonda. Él comienza su búsqueda tras un sueño de Camelot y su idealismo del Nuevo Orden.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MWQnFA2qO8LCjBqn0yx3kIqS17.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lvOSZaLxPMUaAoyv3Yf8fgavXpJ.jpg","voteAverage":6.7,"voteCount":17,"releaseDate":"1991-09-03","genres":["Animación","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":529,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":13577,"title":"Annie Oakley","originalTitle":"Annie Oakley","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VdzIUm8bYpQHM1eyzXEyZRhfgd.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ovUZ1545CqMw5LnQZoars7RxDzM.jpg","voteAverage":5.6,"voteCount":9,"releaseDate":"1954-01-09","genres":["Western","Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":13577,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":13386,"title":"Bramwell","originalTitle":"Bramwell","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVJeLDU7Lif61tux7aFzGeXDotb.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3GgDspm4goTCOWo9ukhZVIqyPsf.jpg","voteAverage":4.2,"voteCount":6,"releaseDate":"1995-05-01","genres":["Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":13386,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":351,"title":"Scare Tactics","originalTitle":"Scare Tactics","overview":"En esta macabra serie de cámara oculta, amigos y familiares utilizan efectos especiales y maquillaje de alta calidad para gastar bromas a víctimas desprevenidas.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSdvAst4xBCf0GICYwOSjTFnE2G.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/exqzni5mLNy