volando por todas partes en la escuela. Luego se encuentra con Alice que se mueve como un humano y le dice que se prepare para una batalla de supervivencia llamada \"Girl Gun Fight\", donde tiene que atacar a sus compañeros de escuela con un arma..","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUYbbBDncfCMpdd7fnnSow4wSa.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/bKiyZdGnT73jfQ887H9M2CbWXUR.jpg","voteAverage":7.4,"voteCount":10,"releaseDate":"2021-04-05","genres":["Drama","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":122631,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":56295,"title":"Halo 4: Adelante hasta el amanecer","originalTitle":"Halo 4: Adelante hasta el amanecer","overview":"Thomas Lasky llega a la Academia de Ciencias Militares para empezar su entrenamiento, siguiendo los pasos de su madre y su hermano. Thomas se siente atormentado por los fantasmas de su pasado. Película de acción ambientada en el universo de la franquicia de videojuegos \"Halo\".","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4E5KXs8vXE8w4Bcb4UgFV9b7sul.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5VGVGickRQ8Wo0szenx3drdCLMi.jpg","voteAverage":7,"voteCount":801,"releaseDate":"2012-10-05","genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":56295,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":33645,"title":"Vexed","originalTitle":"Vexed","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59o2pR35cC5zyUeH3xzmj5ZjIRO.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/v6lnzmTlB8fZloMFl5qt0BcGKV2.jpg","voteAverage":6.9,"voteCount":42,"releaseDate":"2010-08-15","genres":["Comedia","Drama","Crimen"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":33645,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":65804,"title":"Saints & Sinners","originalTitle":"Saints & Sinners","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t