Documental"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":97630,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":14874,"title":"72 Horas: True Crime","originalTitle":"72 Horas: True Crime","overview":"Programa de crímenes canadiense que se centra en las 72 primeras horas tras el crimen, un plazo crítico para resolverlo. La serie mezcla dramatizaciones y material documental.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqbMswEAccLvvKdmhmZXY0XYUcr.jpg","backdropPath":"/placeholder-backdrop.jpg","voteAverage":6.6,"voteCount":5,"releaseDate":"2003-11-04","genres":["Documental","Misterio","Crimen"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":14874,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":118512,"title":"Cesar Millan: Mejores Humanos, Mejores Perros","originalTitle":"Cesar Millan: Mejores Humanos, Mejores Perros","overview":"Los dueños de mascotas necesitan ayuda más que nunca en todo Estados Unidos. Afortunadamente, hay esperanza porque César Millán está listo para enfrentar los casos más desafiantes que haya tenido.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rno3lwMif4qAfX7U0OYlbuSMQdq.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7jY0OJGBlbAXVfiYi4ojvLzxBp3.jpg","voteAverage":8.6,"voteCount":9,"releaseDate":"2021-07-30","genres":["Reality"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":118512,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":40202,"title":"Mussolini: The Untold Story","originalTitle":"Mussolini: The Untold Story","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLyic24ZWh5HgkIg6hTLFnsxQoa.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/77CFC0VXTB8kYsmYdU1Rl4eQ1qM.jpg","voteAverage":5.3,"voteCount":11,"releaseDate":"1985-11-24","genres":["Drama","War & Politics"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":40202,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":201910,"title":"Rent-A-Girlfriend","originalTitle":"Rent-A-Girlfriend","overview":"En el Japón de hoy, los servicios de \"alquiler\" pueden ofrecer una tarde con un \"amigo\", un \"padre\", ¡incluso una novia falsa! Después de una asombrosa traición por parte de su novia, el desafortunado estudiante de primer año Kazuya se desespera lo suficiente como para intentarlo. Pero rápidamente descubre lo complicado que puede ser \"alquilar\" una conexión emocional, y su nueva \"novia\", que está tratando de mantener en secreto su trabajo secundario, entrará en pánico cuando descubra que su vida real y la de Kazuya están entrelazadas de maneras sorprendentes. La familia, la escuela y la vida también empiezan a ir mal... Es un chico dulce pero ingenuo que conoce a una chica linda pero despiadada.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8PVj8iuESEeF9rsPOB8JmQmccj.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ySBgNFRLSiCYmS6LCqXMTRLMl31.jpg","voteAverage":6.2,"voteCount":8,"releaseDate":"2022-07-02","genres":["Drama","Comedia"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":201910,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":218692,"title":"Stalkers","originalTitle":"Stalkers","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzhHt2qNCWRS1v8c6NmI4DdkOzt.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sIe8cVWJIsxw7o6ZQetkshgKTre.jpg","voteAverage":4.8,"voteCount":5,"releaseDate":"2023-02-26","genres":["Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":218692,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":14381,"title":"The Moment of Truth","originalTitle":"The Moment of Truth","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMlpuKuEEqSfxNiXAhMvV1rSUm0.jpg","backdropPath":"/placeholder-backdrop.jpg","voteAverage":6,"voteCount":11,"releaseDate":"2008-01-23","genres":["Reality"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":14381,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":75585,"title":"Points de Repères","originalTitle":"Points de Repères","overview":"Sin descripción disponible."