in descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qR1qJKdW31Khum5MrVZQ7PKFgt1.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/oN2jGaCTAHpUELdXtafF2hFQ7ij.jpg","voteAverage":6.6,"voteCount":6,"releaseDate":"2011-06-18","genres":["Documental"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":61526,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":79499,"title":"The Witching Season","originalTitle":"The Witching Season","overview":"Alimentada por la nostalgia, esta antología de cortometrajes de terror narra originales historias de terror ambientadas en la temporada de Halloween.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZ7lWlFPc0KpobY1P4WI66DM3XW.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iyVVFoOoJJncMujN9UnUnaAxZRF.jpg","voteAverage":6.7,"voteCount":10,"releaseDate":"2015-08-27","genres":["Misterio"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":79499,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":16815,"title":"La leyenda del Dragón","originalTitle":"La leyenda del Dragón","overview":"China, una tierra de antiguos misterios y modernas tendencias; un mundo donde lo antiguo se encuentra con lo actual, la oscuridad se encuentra con la luz, el balance universal del Yin y Yang está estable gracias a uno sólo, el Dragón Dorado. La vida del guardián del templo del Dragón se apaga, y ahora un nuevo guardián debe ser elegido. La elección está entre un hermano y una hermana, gemelos, nacidos en el año del Dragón. Sólo uno será elegido para defender el templo del malvado Master del Zodíaco, el otro será tentado para unirse a la parte oscura del Yin y destruir los 12 templos perdidos de los antiguos zodíacos chinos y sus guardianes. El viaje de estos chicos y chicas, de coraje y descubrimiento personal, decidirá el futuro y una nueva leyenda nacerá: \"La Leyenda del Dragón\".","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1haLf3upZNAJprM6SKiyRgvkyAE.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qge31yAWAFb5S48UEeuzt9UEqs5.jpg","voteAverage":7.8,"voteCount":9,"releaseDate":"2006-08-06","genres":["Animación","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":16815,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":22783,"title":"Crime Stories","originalTitle":"Crime Stories","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6UnbgyDUk6y1wofneC7tp4tzOT.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9NSc7bCHxJnBWsb6v6e57trfVHP.jpg","voteAverage":8.2,"voteCount":6,"releaseDate":"1999-01-01","genres":["Crimen","Documental"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":22783,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":216802,"title":"El asesino de la baraja","originalTitle":"El asesino de la baraja","overview":"La historia de los crímenes en serie ocurridos en Madrid que tuvieron en jaque tanto a la Policía Nacional como a la Guardia Civil durante los 7 primeros meses del año 2003.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umeX5Xrxa2zNtpbcV1uREzImuOM.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/tdFjxdKrIVkoJLMAihelZa40NhG.jpg","voteAverage":6.8,"voteCount":13,"releaseDate":"2022-12-21","genres":["Documental","Crimen","Drama"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":216802,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":9830,"title":"Dennis Miller Live","originalTitle":"Dennis Miller Live","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpRMMvInhtTwVU38Ve7zHl5tRDD.jpg","backdropPath":"/placeholder-backdrop.jpg","voteAverage":7,"voteCount":9,"releaseDate":"","genres":["Comedia","Talk"],"type":"series","platforms":["$c"],"tmdbId":9830,"runtime":"$undefined","seasons":"$undefined"},{"id":104938,"title":"The Secret Lives Of Big Cats","originalTitle":"The Secret Lives Of Big Cats","overview":"Sin descripción disponible.","posterPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PhNYkSfZIVaAn0b4VXmJuUcOsb.jpg","backdropPath":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/yr